meta {
  name: ClientPulse Backend
  type: collection
  ignore: node_modules
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # ClientPulse Backend

  Single Railway service — HTTP + WebSocket backend for ClientPulse.

  **Base URL:** `{{baseUrl}}`

  ## Modules

  | Module | What it does |
  | --- | --- |
  | **Integration Hub** | Express routes for incoming webhooks + OAuth flows |
  | **WebSocket** | Socket.io real-time push to frontend |
  | **Workflow Engine** | BullMQ job queue + node-cron scheduled triggers |

  See `openapi.yaml` in the repo root for the full HTTP API spec.
}
